    "detailed_description": "When MOM needs help, transform yourself and go on a journey.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBegin ILL\u2019s adventure. Help MOM to recover and save your planet. Find out two endings of the story. Go through 50 different escape rooms. Use a rope, roll, jump, fly, dive, bounce, collect galaxies and energy. MOM needs more energy. Bring it to her.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat\u2019s waiting for you:<br />\r\n\u2013 an interesting adventure and arcade game scenario,<br />\r\n\u2013 2 different endings,<br />\r\n\u2013 50 levels,<br />\r\n\u2013 surprising extra escape rooms,<br />\r\n\u2013 great fun for hours,<br />\r\n\u2013 an ending that you agree with?!",
